
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5062

# BestStories API requests

### Get top 1 story
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/beststories?count=1
Accept: application/json

### Get top 10 stories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/beststories?count=10
Accept: application/json

### Invalid: count 0 (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/beststories?count=0
Accept: application/json

### Invalid: count > 500 (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/beststories?count=501
Accept: application/json

###
